<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  Approvals viewer — "Approvals · The Conn" — kept alive at http://localhost:4319.

  WHY THIS EXISTS: every other piece of the social pipeline was already a
  LaunchAgent — the drain ships every 15 min, both intake doors run on timers — but
  the one surface a HUMAN needs was on-demand only. It ran when someone remembered
  to run it. On 2026-08-08 five HLD posts sat "Ready — approve to ship" for 31 days
  with the approval page not running. An approval gate you have to boot is a gate
  that stays shut.

  UNLIKE the other three plists here, this is a long-running server, so:
    RunAtLoad true   — up as soon as you log in
    KeepAlive true   — relaunched if it dies (launchd throttles restarts to 10s)
    no StartInterval — it is not a timer job

  Binds 127.0.0.1:4319 only. Port checked free 2026-08-08 (`lsof -nP -iTCP:4319`);
  localhost-only matters here — a wildcard bind would expose the vault's contents
  to the LAN, and Node/Bun default to dual-stack `*` if you let them.

  Runs via queue-server.sh, which resolves BLOTATO_API_KEY through the same
  1Password service-account pipeline the drain uses. The key is OPTIONAL: without
  it the cards still render, they just show "unknown (no Blotato)" instead of
  ready/blocked.

  It only ever writes the `approved`/`status` frontmatter the drain already reads —
  the vault stays the bus, and this page cannot publish anything by itself.

  Install:
    cp scripts/com.ryan.queue-server.plist ~/Library/LaunchAgents/
    launchctl load ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.ryan.queue-server.plist
  Uninstall:
    launchctl unload ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.ryan.queue-server.plist
  Watch:
    tail -f ~/.ade/queue-server.log
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>Label</key>
    <string>com.ryan.queue-server</string>
    <key>ProgramArguments</key>
    <array>
        <string>/bin/bash</string>
        <string>/Users/ryannaquin/Code/damon-ade/scripts/queue-server.sh</string>
    </array>
    <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
    <string>/Users/ryannaquin/Code/damon-ade</string>
    <key>RunAtLoad</key>
    <true/>
    <key>KeepAlive</key>
    <true/>
    <key>StandardOutPath</key>
    <string>/Users/ryannaquin/.ade/queue-server.log</string>
    <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
    <string>/Users/ryannaquin/.ade/queue-server.log</string>
    <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
    <dict>
        <key>PATH</key>
        <string>/Users/ryannaquin/.bun/bin:/Users/ryannaquin/.local/bin:/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin</string>
    </dict>
</dict>
</plist>
